WEBVTT

00:00:12.808 --> 00:00:13.764
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hi, Pamela.

00:00:15.262 --> 00:00:17.155
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

00:00:17.638 --> 00:00:18.883
I thought I heard you.

00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:24.003
Aren’t you working today?

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.015
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No, I took the day off.

00:00:33.456 --> 00:00:34.573
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Are you OK?

00:00:39.407 --> 00:00:39.834
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No.

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:43.447
Ben and I had a big argument last night.

00:00:46.581 --> 00:00:48.194
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> I’m sorry to hear that.

00:00:57.417 --> 00:00:58.805
Have you been out today?

00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:00.197
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No.

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:02.399
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Come on.

00:01:03.369 --> 00:01:04.821
Let’s go for a walk.

00:01:17.587 --> 00:01:21.263
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> It was so embarrassing…and…

00:01:22.399 --> 00:01:24.609
our relationship has been difficult recently.

00:01:26.599 --> 00:01:28.787
I just don’t understand him anymore.

00:01:30.643 --> 00:01:31.213
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Well…

00:01:32.642 --> 00:01:35.542
sometimes people are difficult to understand.

00:01:37.091 --> 00:01:38.047
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> What’s his problem?

00:01:38.787 --> 00:01:40.294
I have this great job.

00:01:41.126 --> 00:01:43.038
I have this great opportunity.

00:01:44.858 --> 00:01:47.905
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> And…he’s just starting his career.

00:01:50.354 --> 00:01:50.781
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:53.658
I think you’re right.

00:01:55.956 --> 00:01:57.041
I know what I want.

00:01:58.111 --> 00:01:59.370
I know who I am.

00:02:00.202 --> 00:02:00.804
Ben doesn’t.

00:02:02.284 --> 00:02:04.058
He wants everything to stay the same.

00:02:04.963 --> 00:02:06.305
It can’t all stay the same.

00:02:12.077 --> 00:02:14.301
Life isn’t like that.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:21.149
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> So…Why don’t you tell that to him?

00:02:34.724 --> 00:02:35.698
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I thought you’d be here.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.581
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Well, here I am.

00:02:44.154 --> 00:02:44.843
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m sorry.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:47.992
I was an idiot.

00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:49.867
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> You were.

00:02:53.355 --> 00:02:55.524
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I don’t know why I didn’t tell you about Max earlier.

00:02:58.415 --> 00:03:00.060
I didn’t tell you how I was feeling.

00:03:01.723 --> 00:03:02.978
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m not interested in Max.

00:03:04.085 --> 00:03:04.917
I never was.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:06.944
He’s just my boss.

00:03:07.054 --> 00:03:07.486
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I know.

00:03:09.292 --> 00:03:09.968
I know now.

00:03:15.202 --> 00:03:15.597
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Look.

00:03:17.031 --> 00:03:18.198
It’s my fault, too.

00:03:19.187 --> 00:03:20.584
I’ve been so busy with my new job,

00:03:21.438 --> 00:03:24.182
I didn’t have enough time to think about us.

00:03:25.216 --> 00:03:25.777
I’m sorry.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.192
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Sure, I get it.

00:03:30.749 --> 00:03:34.568
You’ve been busy and you’re doing really well.

00:03:37.831 --> 00:03:38.571
I’m proud of you.

00:03:40.147 --> 00:03:40.694
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks.

00:03:42.431 --> 00:03:45.184
I’m sorry if you feel like I’ve left you behind.

00:03:46.705 --> 00:03:48.157
You’re so talented.

00:03:49.508 --> 00:03:51.815
One day you’re going to be a great photographer.

00:03:53.157 --> 00:03:53.663
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks.

00:03:57.973 --> 00:04:04.646
You know…when we met we were in the same place in life.

00:04:09.168 --> 00:04:11.100
Now we’re in very different places.

00:04:14.049 --> 00:04:14.876
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think you’re right.

00:04:18.051 --> 00:04:21.489
This new job is really important to me.

00:04:23.272 --> 00:04:24.724
It’s what I’ve always wanted to do.

00:04:27.348 --> 00:04:27.670
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.636
You’ve found the right place for you.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:38.281
But I don’t think your job leaves enough time for us.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:40.947
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah.

00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:48.061
And…you need somebody who wants the same things as you want right now…

00:04:57.436 --> 00:04:58.815
I don’t think I’m that person.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.269
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> So is this it?

00:05:07.086 --> 00:05:07.573
The end?

00:05:09.802 --> 00:05:10.652
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think so.

00:05:16.117 --> 00:05:16.912
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I think so, too.

00:05:20.818 --> 00:05:22.201
We were really good together.

00:05:24.637 --> 00:05:25.165
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> We were.

00:05:43.249 --> 00:05:44.714
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> You know that now my back’s better,

00:05:44.715 --> 00:05:46.277
I could beat Max in a race, right?

00:05:50.018 --> 00:05:50.519
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I know.